    <guid isPermaLink="false">66e8580c5ca6d0ace35bff78</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 16 Sep 2024 16:08:44 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Highlight：</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#"><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="20">00:20</a></span></strong></a><span>：如何在不晒成龙虾的情况下美黑</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#"><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="330">05:30</a></span></strong></a><span>：中美美黑理念交流</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#"><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="677">11:17</a></span></strong></a><span>：关于时尚，我的脑子里只有舒服二字</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#"><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="874">14:34</a></span></strong></a><span>：对“服美役”的看法，极简护肤程序，在护肤这一块子当直男</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#"><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1331">22:11</a></span></strong></a><span>：旅行时选择餐厅的原则：P人就近原则</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#"><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1812">30:12</a></span></strong></a><span>：上海高端法餐老板跑路，对于概念美食，还能割多少韭菜</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#"><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2101">35:01</a></span></strong></a><span>：独自旅行中，遇到的所有人都是旅行搭子</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#"><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2407">40:07</a></span></strong></a><span>：下班后当“流水线公主”有错吗？我想当壮族母豹子</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#"><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2719">45:19</a></span></strong></a><span>：在旅行中如何捕捉生动瞬间，博主不是人人都能当的</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#"><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2770">46:10</a></span></strong></a><span>：下期预告，教授辣妈来袭</span></p><span></span><p><span>关于播客：</span></p><span></span><p><span>五年前，我们来到美国，Peng取得商科和工程的两个硕士学位，桢桢即将博士毕业。现在，我们分别居住在中美两国，想要和你分享正在经历的，正在发生的探索，碰撞和成长。</span></p><span></span><p><span>兜风TenderBreeze每周更新。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本节目收听方式：</span></p><span></span><p><span>苹果podcast ｜小宇宙｜喜马拉雅｜网易云音乐｜Spotify</span></p>]]></description>
