  <item>
    <title>美漂坦白局：我在美国当房东，真的躺着把钱赚了？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66b85194db5e6d6bf96ba5da</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66b85194db5e6d6bf96ba5da</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 11 Aug 2024 05:52:19 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>侍弄花花草草，整点儿兴趣爱好，和闺蜜喝喝下午茶，看手机银行提醒每月租金到账——是你羡慕的房东生活吗？这期我们请了嘉宾柳柳，讲述她在美全职当房东的经历。钻法律漏洞蹭住的无赖，被骗的单亲妈妈，理不清的伦理关系，用房东的角度看到人生百态，展示美国社会的一个切面。除了八卦，我们还分享了一些投资当房东，和在美租房的小tips，我们这就开始吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span>Highlights:</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="343">05:43</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>回家在门口看到爬满蚂蚁的grocery，求我的心理阴影面积</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="563">09:23</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>高端小区有免费咖啡和酒</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="648">10:48</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>一人一个美国租房小tips</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1426">23:46</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>租客被狗追着跑，像梦里会出现的场景</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1828">30:28</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>白天打架，晚上和好，鸡飞狗跳的生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2242">37:22</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>伪造租约，还是美国人野路子多</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2446">40:46</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>遇到30%正常人我就满足了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2816">46:56</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>当房东的我见识了人类的多样性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3075">51:15</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>就像打开一盒巧克力，永远不知道下一个房门打开里面有什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3149">52:29</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>早上手机开机，悬着的心终于死了</span></p><span></span><p><span>关于播客：</span></p><span></span><p><span>五年前，我们来到美国，Peng取得商科和工程的两个硕士学位，桢桢即将博士毕业。现在，我们分别居住在中美两国，想要和你分享正在经历的，正在发生的探索，碰撞和成长。</span></p><span></span><p><span>兜风TenderBreeze每周三准时更新。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本节目收听方式：</span></p><span></span><p><span>苹果podcast ｜小宇宙｜喜马拉雅｜网易云音乐｜Spotify</span></p><span></span><p><span>还有在哪里可以找到我们？</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>Pengpeng （小红书号：263239322）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>墨西哥湾大蝠鲼</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>兜风Tender Breeze</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
