    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>个人风格的建立-千帆过尽，归来竟是中超T恤</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66aad7f533ddcbb53c7edcf8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66aad7f533ddcbb53c7edcf8</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 01 Aug 2024 00:33:57 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>每个人的衣橱都是一片片拼图搭建的自我呈现，风格背后一定是有着自己态度和想法。在尝试了各种各样的风格后，反而让自己穿着舒服是最重要的。扔掉高跟，换上勃肯，去到更远的地方。在户外，可以打滚，可以追逐大笑，可以做一个手倒立。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>可以选择驳回那些随意的评价，拒绝对狭隘的审美定义妥协。穿上让你舒服又自信的衣服，去被阳光亲吻。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Highlight：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="133">02:13</a></span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>青春时期的时尚态度</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="326">05:26</a></span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>上大学后的自我风格探索</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="593">09:53</a></span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>当把找到自己风格这件事当作事业来做</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="825">13:45</a></span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>现在回看大学时期的衣橱，还能留下几件？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="944">15:44</a></span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>风格的转折点--来到美国大学校园之后</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1278">21:18</a></span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>对T恤的恨爱交加</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1436">23:56</a></span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>商学院和工科院气质一眼看穿</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1707">28:27</a></span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>被阳光亲吻，在一声声赞美中逐渐迷失自己</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1943">32:23</a></span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>那些被轻易评论的时刻，一些狭窄的审美定义</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2708">45:08</a></span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>现在的风格想表达的态度</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>关于播客：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>五年前，我们来到美国，Peng取得商科和工程的两个硕士学位，桢桢即将博士毕业。现在，我们分别居住在中美两国，想要和你分享正在经历的，正在发生的探索，碰撞和成长。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>兜风TenderBreeze每周三准时更新。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本节目收听方式：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>苹果podcast ｜小宇宙｜喜马拉雅｜网易云音乐｜Spotify</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>还有在哪里可以找到我们？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>小红书：</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>Pengpeng （小红书号：263239322）</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>墨西哥湾大蝠鲼</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>兜风Tender Breeze</span></strong></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
