  <item>
    <title>夏日特辑 ｜ 运动是辣妹的宿命我了解</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6697d8548fcadceb90099253</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6697d8548fcadceb90099253</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 17 Jul 2024 14:42:28 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>从场边到场上，从被审美标准裹挟到成为自己人生的主角，运动一点点改变着我们的生活态度和方式。认真选择吃下的每一口食物，合理规划一周的运动行程，自信和满足感在每个晚风吹干皮肤表面的薄汗时慢慢充盈胸腔，给我面对每一个挑战的力量和能量。emo, 饮食失调，这一期来听听我们在运动这条路上经历了些什么，这个旅程你从不孤单。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="128">02:08</a></span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>最早接触运动的原因是喜欢体育生</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="554">09:14</a></span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>到了美国后，多元审美环境下建立起自信</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="610">10:10</a></span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>你Peng姐少女时期被说腿太壮也emo过</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="752">12:32</a></span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Zhen在身材焦虑时也严格控制过饮食</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="955">15:55</a></span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>白人饭，我从小吃到大</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1021">17:01</a></span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>陕西人的早餐：碳水配碳水</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1171">19:31</a></span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>如何在十分钟内做好一顿健康餐</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1402">23:22</a></span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>地中海饮食结构怎么吃</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1554">25:54</a></span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>老美的白人饭长啥样</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1733">28:53</a></span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>我们最近的训练日常安排</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1971">32:51</a></span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>从蹦迪到5点到一周5练，经历了什么</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2401">40:01</a></span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>下一阶段运动小目标</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2483">41:23</a></span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>80岁，我们还要当辣奶</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>关于播客：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>五年前，我们来到美国，Peng取得商科和工程的两个硕士学位，桢桢即将博士毕业。现在，我们分别居住在中美两国，想要和你分享正在经历的，正在发生的探索，碰撞和成长。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>兜风TenderBreeze每周三晚零点准时更新。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本节目收听方式：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>苹果podcast ｜小宇宙｜喜马拉雅｜网易云音乐｜Spotify</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>还有在哪里可以找到我们？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>小红书：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/55e08f93a75c9554b1a1550c?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=55e08f93a75c9554b1a1550c&amp;apptime=1719367623" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/55e08f93a75c9554b1a1550c?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=55e08f93a75c9554b1a1550c&amp;apptime=1719367623"><strong><span>Peng</span></strong></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5c824a600000000016033c7a?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5c824a600000000016033c7a&amp;apptime=1719367607" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5c824a600000000016033c7a?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5c824a600000000016033c7a&amp;apptime=1719367607"><strong><span>Zhen</span></strong></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/663d839f0000000003030eb9?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=663d839f0000000003030eb9&amp;apptime=1719367796" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/663d839f0000000003030eb9?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=663d839f0000000003030eb9&amp;apptime=1719367796"><strong><span>兜风 Tender Breeze podcast</span></strong></a></p>]]></description>
