  <item>
    <title>西方心理医生治好了我的东方心理问题｜小留倾情分享崩溃日常</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6684c43653526fced02dc358</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6684c43653526fced02dc358</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 03 Jul 2024 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>面对生活中的各种突发状况，我们像一艘小船行驶在暗流涌动的大海上。我们看似很平静，偶尔也会透露出一丝淡淡的疯意。那些在异国他乡的奔溃日常，我们是如何度过的。通过心理医生的帮助，让我们在风暴中，也可以看到远方传来温暖坚定的光。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>下次遇到蟑螂，深呼吸，然后像处理数据一样处理它。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Hightlight:</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="53">00:00:53</a></span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>我们这期的灵感来源于一只蟑螂</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="422">00:07:02</a></span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>一觉醒来，开门发现楼梯被拆了，物业说把我忘了</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="648">00:10:48</a></span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>不被邻居举报的小妙招是把邻居都喊来开趴体</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="739">00:12:19</a></span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>亲身经历的美式霸凌和中式霸凌</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1275">00:21:15</a></span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>选择看心理医生的原因，我们可以不用一个人面对</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1767">00:29:27</a></span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>心理医生是如何帮到我们的，应对低谷期的方案</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2180">00:36:20</a></span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>想象自己被爱包裹着，拥抱接纳自己</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2361">00:39:21</a></span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>couple therapy 大乌龙事件</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2676">00:44:36</a></span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>经常觉得累，可以试试精力管理</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3417">00:56:57</a></span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>处理分手的SOP</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3561">00:59:21</a></span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>脱敏练习，让自己伤感的情绪尽情流淌</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Mentioned:</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1MG411c7TS/?vd_source=ff033421e2193d19f9501225a67d4229" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1MG411c7TS/?vd_source=ff033421e2193d19f9501225a67d4229"><strong><span>【纪录片】斯图茨 Stutz (2022)</span></strong></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/26606009/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/26606009/"><strong><span>书籍精力管理</span></strong></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>呼吸练习方法：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><strong><span>关于播客：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>五年前，我们来到美国，Peng取得商科和工程的两个硕士学位，桢桢即将博士毕业。现在，我们分别居住在中美两国，想要和你分享正在经历的，正在发生的探索，碰撞和成长。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>兜风TenderBreeze每周三晚零点准时更新。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本节目收听方式：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>苹果podcast ｜小宇宙｜喜马拉雅｜网易云音乐｜Spotify</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>还有在哪里可以找到我们？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>小红书：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/55e08f93a75c9554b1a1550c?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=55e08f93a75c9554b1a1550c&amp;apptime=1719367623" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/55e08f93a75c9554b1a1550c?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=55e08f93a75c9554b1a1550c&amp;apptime=1719367623"><strong><span>Peng</span></strong></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5c824a600000000016033c7a?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5c824a600000000016033c7a&amp;apptime=1719367607" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5c824a600000000016033c7a?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5c824a600000000016033c7a&amp;apptime=1719367607"><strong><span>Zhen</span></strong></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/663d839f0000000003030eb9?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=663d839f0000000003030eb9&amp;apptime=1719367796" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/663d839f0000000003030eb9?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=663d839f0000000003030eb9&amp;apptime=1719367796"><strong><span>兜风 Tender Breeze podcast</span></strong></a></p>]]></description>
