  <item>
    <title>与卡戴珊家族同行学做个人品牌</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/667b7e85c37399840c26157f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">667b7e85c37399840c26157f</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 26 Jun 2024 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>这期的灵感来自于Kris Jenner的建立个人品牌大师课，如何让​​​​​​​自己成为一个行走的、会说话的、有故事的品牌。 利​​用愿景板视觉表达自己的想法和个人风格，可以从构建一个自己的花园，到建立自己的人生愿景。在愿景板上可以把自己的个人故事和整体风格相融合，让你的个人形象和价值观，像WiFi信号一样，无处不在，无时不刻不在吸引着同频的人。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>面对未来种种可能，相信你有很多期待，不如和我们一起把这些人生目标具象化，用Kris Jenner的商业方法论，做一个属于你的个人品牌。这期我们从个人品牌五要素和vision board 聊起，在心里种下这颗创业的小种子。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>时间线Highlights：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="83">01:23</a></span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>上周为什么断更，生活中处处是挑战</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="197">03:17</a></span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>坐着轮椅我也要去迪士尼</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="269">04:29</a></span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Kris Jenner大师课，教你做个人品牌愿景</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="313">05:13</a></span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>卡戴珊家族的女人们个人品牌价值</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="723">12:03</a></span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>营造个人品牌的五个罗马柱</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1036">17:16</a></span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>我们的故事，我们想成为什么样的人</span></strong></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1576">26:16</a></span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>建立个人品牌的愿景板</span></strong></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1836">30:36</a></span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Case study，做一个户外二手装备社区平台</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2432">40:32</a></span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>在上海建立带社交属性的狗公园，遛狗洗狗交狗一条路服务</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2760">46:00</a></span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>在建立个人品牌路上，我们现在就可以做的事</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2848">47:28</a></span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>为我们的播客兜风，制作愿景板</span></strong></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3117">51:57</a></span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>下期预告，聊聊情绪和发疯时刻</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>​​</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Mentioned：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.masterclass.com/classes/kris-jenner-on-the-power-of-personal-branding?utm_campaign=%5BKJ%5C+%7C+Search+%7C+Brand+%7C+Instructor_PM+%7C+USA+%7C+EN+%7C+TIS+%7C+EG%7CPP+%7C+INS+-+KJ+%7C+USA&amp;utm_source=google&amp;utm_medium=cpc&amp;utm_content=677007640042&amp;utm_term=kris%20jenner%20masterclass&amp;campaignid=20648098443&amp;adgroupid=154599654476&amp;adid=677007640042&amp;gad_source=1&amp;gclid=CjwKCAjw1emzBhB8EiwAHwZZxYqMHfoMNclybOs2btOykAOveLMUwSbDdou6tzmrR5ATDIhMho4xTxoCapwQAvD_BwE" data-url="https://www.masterclass.com/classes/kris-jenner-on-the-power-of-personal-branding?utm_campaign=%5BKJ%5C+%7C+Search+%7C+Brand+%7C+Instructor_PM+%7C+USA+%7C+EN+%7C+TIS+%7C+EG%7CPP+%7C+INS+-+KJ+%7C+USA&amp;utm_source=google&amp;utm_medium=cpc&amp;utm_content=677007640042&amp;utm_term=kris%20jenner%20masterclass&amp;campaignid=20648098443&amp;adgroupid=154599654476&amp;adid=677007640042&amp;gad_source=1&amp;gclid=CjwKCAjw1emzBhB8EiwAHwZZxYqMHfoMNclybOs2btOykAOveLMUwSbDdou6tzmrR5ATDIhMho4xTxoCapwQAvD_BwE"><strong><span>Kris Jenner个人品牌大师课</span></strong></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>On the Power of Personal Branding</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>关于播客：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>五年前，我们来到美国，Peng取得商科和工程的两个硕士学位，桢桢即将博士毕业。现在，我们分别居住在中美两国，想要和你分享正在经历的，正在发生的探索，碰撞和成长。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>兜风TenderBreeze每周三晚零点准时更新。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本节目收听方式：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>苹果podcast ｜小宇宙｜喜马拉雅｜网易云音乐｜Spotify</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>还有在哪里可以找到我们？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>小红书：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/55e08f93a75c9554b1a1550c?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=55e08f93a75c9554b1a1550c&amp;apptime=1719367623" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/55e08f93a75c9554b1a1550c?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=55e08f93a75c9554b1a1550c&amp;apptime=1719367623"><strong><span>Peng</span></strong></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5c824a600000000016033c7a?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5c824a600000000016033c7a&amp;apptime=1719367607" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5c824a600000000016033c7a?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5c824a600000000016033c7a&amp;apptime=1719367607"><strong><span>Zhen</span></strong></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/663d839f0000000003030eb9?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=663d839f0000000003030eb9&amp;apptime=1719367796" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/663d839f0000000003030eb9?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=663d839f0000000003030eb9&amp;apptime=1719367796"><strong><span>兜风 Tender Breeze podcast</span></strong></a></p>]]></description>
